{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Darkflock channels for 8 seconds, keeps channeling while moving and stops when another ability is cast (#3938)",
  "contract": [
    "Darkflock (ranks 520270, 520708, 520709, 562024, 562025) carries the channel-only ChannelInterruptFlags and",
    "AttributesEx5 0x1 (channel while moving) but no channel bit in Spell.dbc, so the server cast it as an instant self",
    "buff that ticked 520271 every 2 s while the Witch Hunter kept casting. The live tooltip reads 'Channeled, Channel for",
    "8 sec ... every 2 sec. Can channel while moving.', and on live another ability ends the channel. Like Sixfold Shot",
    "and Twilight Frenzy (#1473), AttributesEx5 0x1 means movement only. Expected: Darkflock is a channel with 7-8 s left",
    "right after the cast; it keeps channeling and dealing 520271 damage while the Witch Hunter moves; it runs out after",
    "8 s; a second Darkflock ends at once when Shadowblast is cast, its aura goes and no further 520271 damage lands."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "location": {"map": 0, "x": -8917.41, "y": -115.853, "z": 82.3711, "o": 0},
  "players": [
    {"id": "wh", "race": 1, "class": 15, "level": 60, "spell_hit_rating": 10000, "ranged_hit_rating": 10000}
  ],
  "creatures": [
